{"availability":"available","full":"sinhgiang/helme-web","name":"helme-web","description":"Website for Helme, the control room that runs a team of AI coding agents from one screen. Product page and version updates.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T16:54:47Z","updated":"2026-10-07T16:17:43Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://helme-web.vercel.app","topics":["ai-agents","helme","landing-page","static-site","vercel"],"demo":"https://helme-web.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:39.065Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:39.065Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:39.065Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:25.745Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:21:39.065Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["You make the decisions. The agents do the rest.","Website · How it works · Features · Safety · FAQ · Updates","Helme is a local control room for AI coding agents. It gives every project its own agent in a real terminal, puts one coordinating agent, the Chief of Staff, in charge of all of them, and has a Reviewer agent check the work before it is merged. A live report area shows what is running, what was reviewed, and the short list of decisions that only the owner can make. It runs on the owner's own Windows PC, with real terminals and plain text files: no cloud service, no database."],"features":["Tabs and panes of real terminals. Every pane is a real Windows terminal shown in the browser. A tab holds up to six panes side by side; panes and tabs can be dragged to a new place, with a preview of exactly where a…","A fixed home. Three tabs are always there: Coordination (the Chief of Staff next to the report area), Tickets (the board) and Review (the Reviewer).","Work in one sentence. The Chief of Staff turns an order into a ticket and types the task straight into the chat of the agent that is already open, or opens the project in a new pane. A busy agent gets a queue.","It follows up, and never types over the owner. Helme tells the Chief when an agent finishes a turn or stops to wait for the owner, and holds its notices back while the owner is writing a message.","A ticket board. Every piece of work is a Markdown file on a board with five columns: Proposed, Approved, Doing, Review, Done. Agents may only propose; the owner approves."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sinhgiang/helme-web/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e4c30c0a2c7a31139d4edc72b31f7c0604d6c669c54d68809ce3c453c21f56e4","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:25.883Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:25.883Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"You make the decisions. The agents do the rest.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sinhgiang/helme-web/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Tell the Chief of Staff what you want, for example \"fix the login crash on the mobile app and ship the","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sinhgiang/helme-web/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e4c30c0a2c7a31139d4edc72b31f7c0604d6c669c54d68809ce3c453c21f56e4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sinhgiang/helme-web/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:25.884Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T11:31:47Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sinhgiang/helme-web/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:25.885Z","hash":"e4c30c0a2c7a31139d4edc72b31f7c0604d6c669c54d68809ce3c453c21f56e4","originalBytes":17518,"storedBytes":17518,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["helme","owner","agent","release","every","one","what","work","updates","own","agents","page","new","only","project","real","chief","version","website","branch","each","repository","staff","reviewer","shots","who","code","github","list","main","review","data","plain","report","shows","test","them","ticket","tickets","v0.5.34","want","whic